# frozen.sha256 pins the engine by the SHA-256 of its bytes. Bytes only mean the
# same thing in every checkout if the checkout writes the same ones, so line
# endings are pinned here instead of left to core.autocrlf on each machine.
# Windows checked the ten engine files out as CRLF and every one of them hashed
# differently, which read as "the engine was edited by hand" ten times over.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sha256 text eol=lf
